# "Return target legendary creature card from your graveyard": on turn 1 Bot1 entombs an Ornithopter (a creature card, not
# legendary) and on turn 2 Bot2 entombs a Headliner Scarlett (legendary, but in Bot2's graveyard). On turn 3 Goryo's Vengeance
# has no legal target, so it is not offered (the refusal); after Bot1 entombs its own Headliner Scarlett the same spell is
# castable on it - the positive control - and it returns with haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Goryo's Vengeance
Island x2
Ornithopter
Headliner Scarlett
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Entomb
Island x6
Headliner Scarlett
Island x11

